</span><span style="color:#228b22"></span>          <span style="color:#8b008b;font-weight:bold">var</span> index = <span style="color:#b452cd">0</span>; <span style="color:#228b22">//起始行數
</span><span style="color:#228b22"></span>
          <span style="color:#228b22">//判斷 若只有一行數據，就是表頭，則不做調整
