</ul>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="background-color:#eed;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span style="color:#8b008b;font-weight:bold">protected</span> <span style="color:#00688b;font-weight:bold">void</span> <span style="color:#008b45">page</span>(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response) <span style="color:#8b008b;font-weight:bold">throws</span> ServletException,
        IOException {
    <span style="color:#00688b;font-weight:bold">int</span> pageNo = WebUtils.<span style="color:#658b00">parseInt</span>(request.<span style="color:#658b00">getParameter</span>(<span style="color:#cd5555">&#34;pageNo&#34;</span>), 1);
    <span style="color:#00688b;font-weight:bold">int</span> pageSize = WebUtils.<span style="color:#658b00">parseInt</span>(request.<span style="color:#658b00">getParameter</span>(<span style="color:#cd5555">&#34;pageSize&#34;</span>), Page.<span style="color:#658b00">PAGE_SIZE</span>);
    Page&lt;Book&gt; page = bookService.<span style="color:#658b00">page</span>(pageNo, pageSize);
    page.<span style="color:#658b00">setUrl</span>(<span style="color:#cd5555">&#34;IndexServlet?action=page&#34;</span>);
    request.<span style="color:#658b00">setAttribute</span>(<span style="color:#cd5555">&#34;page&#34;</span>, page);
    request.<span style="color:#658b00">getRequestDispatcher</span>(<span style="color:#cd5555">&#34;/pages/client/index.jsp&#34;</span>).<span style="color:#658b00">forward</span>(request, response);
    }
</code></pre></div><ul>
<li>他轉址到&quot;/pages/client/index.jsp&quot;這個才是真正的首頁，這邊遍歷顯示商品跟分頁導航功能</li>
</ul>
